                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{4-donut package: price per donut}&=\\frac{\\$1.55}{4}=\\$0.3875\\\\\\text{6-donut package: price per donut}&=\\frac{\\$2.30}{6}=\\$0.38\\dot{3}\\\\\\text{10-donut package: price per donut}&=\\frac{\\$3.75}{10}=\\$0.375\\end{align*}$$\nThe 10-donut package for \\$3.75 has the lowest price per donut, so it is the best buy.",
