                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "In package order: $23.25, $23 and $22.50. The 10-donut package for $3.75 is the best buy.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{4-donut packages: cost of 60}&=\\frac{60}{4}\\times\\$1.55\\\\&=15\\times\\$1.55=\\$23.25\\\\\\text{6-donut packages: cost of 60}&=\\frac{60}{6}\\times\\$2.30\\\\&=10\\times\\$2.30=\\$23\\\\\\text{10-donut packages: cost of 60}&=\\frac{60}{10}\\times\\$3.75\\\\&=6\\times\\$3.75=\\$22.50\\end{align*}$$\nThe 10-donut package for \\$3.75 gives the lowest cost for 60 donuts, so it is the best buy.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 40
